      "heading_context": "## Decision Cheat Sheet",
      "headers": [
        "Question",
        "Answer"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "How many bird species?",
          "~10,600 described and recognized"
        ],
        [
          "What order has the most species?",
          "Passeriformes (~6,500 spp; 60% of all birds)"
        ],
        [
          "What is the sister group to birds?",
          "Crocodilians (both Archosauria)"
        ],
        [
          "Are birds dinosaurs?",
          "Yes -- Avialae is within Theropoda within Saurischia"
        ],
        [
          "What defines a bird?",
          "Feathers, wishbone, keeled sternum (most), endothermy, avian lung"
        ],
        [
          "What is unique about the avian lung?",
          "Rigid; unidirectional air flow; cross-current gas exchange"
        ],
        [
          "What are ratites?",
          "Flightless Palaeognathae (ostriches, emus, rheas, kiwis) -- polyphyletic"
        ],
        [
          "Fastest bird?",
          "Peregrine falcon (stoop); White-throated needletail (level flight ~170km/h)"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
